<span id="A2.T3.2.1.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">To: Whom It May Concern […] I am writing to express my utter disgust and disappointment at your recent decision to take away our right to choose. Your actions are not only hurtful, but they are also completely unjust. You are taking away our freedom, our freedom to choose, our freedom to make our own decisions […]</span>
